{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11042","headline":"陪诸贵公子丈八沟携妓纳凉晚际遇雨二首 二 · 杜甫","name":"陪诸贵公子丈八沟携妓纳凉晚际遇雨二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨来沾席上，风急打船头。\n越女红帬湿，燕姬翠黛愁。\n缆侵堤柳系，幔宛浪花浮。\n归路飜萧飒，陂塘五月秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}